Documenting the erroneously merged ticket #4471.

There were two types of bugs affecting tenants and explaining why they see the wrong date.

1. Wrong date locale. Users input DD/MM/YYYY whereas the parser expects month-first format.

2. booking-v3 prompts users to input MM/DD/YYYY, but the app interprets that as DD/MM/YYYY.

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

The two causes should be split into different tickets.

